  "Info": {
    "Name": "Relay Light",
    "Version": 1,
    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Relay Light uses pale silver surfaces with graphite icons and a bright lime accent. The controls are built from rounded bars, slots, and solid shapes, with small lime details that resemble markings on a control panel. The custom \"ig\" logo follows the same design, and the menus and gallery use slightly darker grays."
  },
